# Not sent to the build of containers/Containerfile: installed dependencies, build output, test
# output, version control, and the local data of a running stack.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vitest
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.install-lock
apps/reference-host/.stack
apps/reference-host/stack/.env
infra/containers/.env
services/export-worker/out
packages/export-latex/out
